Coop: study with your friends.
- Private rooms for up to 8 people sharing one Pomodoro: anyone can start, pause or skip the break.
- Join with a code or a link, or invite your friends.
- Notifications when you're invited to a room or get a friend request.
- The account is optional and only for Coop: the rest of the app still needs no account.
- FlowTime Pro is now also available monthly, besides the one-time purchase.
